<programme channel="ATBD800001VA" start="20261122110000 +0000" stop="20261122113000 +0000">
    <title>Off Peak</title>
    <desc>Troy is one of the world's most iconic destinations. The ancient city in Turkey was the setting for the Iliad, the epic poem that tells the story of the final year of the Trojan War. The spotlight has been back on Troy this year with the release "The Odyssey", the much-acclaimed film that charts Odysseus' journey home after the Trojan War. We travel to present-day Canakkale, where Troy was located, to try to unravel fact from fiction, as well as discovering what the area has to offer out of peak season.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/AT_USQT620324A_1966006374_1_20260627T030656992Z_130_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-66fc4d58c8-8v7hn.png" />
    <rating>
      <value>NA</value>
    </rating>
  </programme>
  
